# always.md — the map of this box  (box-local: the real paths live here)

Copy to always.md and fill in the real addresses. Every line is a static
anchor; anything that changes daily belongs in the store, not here.

Server: address and port; where the memory pages ride; the served model id.
Paths: repo (and branch), store, slot vault, bench records, journal.
The standing cart: which files stand on this box and the rotation law.
Other boxes: separate stores; never cross-write; the sweep sits out of venue days.
Open queue: what waits for a quiet night — this line ages; rewrite or delete it.
